# codes: T0011
# status: 1
# at: 8:8
# contains: couldn't match type Returns α with type Command
# contains: this block is a command, but a block that returns a value is wanted here: return its output, `{ |…| return !{…} }`
# A let-binding wrapper requires a value-producing argument (SPEC §17.5).
let time = { |t| let r = !$t; $r }
time { echo hi }
let n = time { return 3 }
echo "n: $n"
